WEBVTT

00:06:57.154 --> 00:07:01.151
And once a genius makes a data file,

00:07:01.175 --> 00:07:03.502
any idiot can copy it,

00:07:03.526 --> 00:07:05.547
distribute it worldwide

00:07:05.571 --> 00:07:07.207
or print it.

00:07:07.231 --> 00:07:09.923
And I don't just mean print it on this,

00:07:09.947 --> 00:07:12.502
but soon enough, on this.

00:07:12.993 --> 00:07:14.896
So let's imagine a scenario.

00:07:15.287 --> 00:07:18.623
Let's say it's 2026,
to pick an arbitrary year,

00:07:18.647 --> 00:07:21.623
and a brilliant virologist,
hoping to advance science

00:07:21.647 --> 00:07:23.953
and better understand pandemics,

00:07:23.977 --> 00:07:25.473
designs a new bug.

00:07:25.957 --> 00:07:28.111
It's as contagious as chicken pox,

00:07:28.135 --> 00:07:30.055
it's as deadly as Ebola,